Input Format
•	First line contains DNA string T.
•	Second line contains pattern string P.
Output Format
Print all starting indices where pattern occurs.
Constraints
•	1 ≤ |T| ≤ 10^6
•	1 ≤ |P| ≤ 10^5
Sample Input
AABAACAADAABAABA
AABA
Sample Output
0 9 12





